---
import { Icon } from "../../../web/src/ui/Icon";
---
<div class="problem-card-stage" role="img" aria-label="Example problem selection: Trapping Rain Water, Hard, Two Pointers; Meeting Rooms II, Medium, Intervals; Two Sum, Easy, Arrays and Hash Table, with a sample input and output.">
  <div class="problem-layer problem-layer-back workspace-demo" aria-hidden="true"><div class="problem-card-heading"><strong>Trapping Rain Water</strong><span class="difficulty difficulty-hard">Hard</span></div><div class="topic-list" data-visible="true"><span>Two Pointers</span></div></div>
  <div class="problem-layer problem-layer-middle workspace-demo" aria-hidden="true"><div class="problem-card-heading"><strong>Meeting Rooms II</strong><span class="difficulty difficulty-medium">Medium</span></div><div class="topic-list" data-visible="true"><span>Intervals</span></div></div>
  <div class="problem-layer problem-layer-front workspace-demo" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="problem-card-heading"><strong>Two Sum</strong><span class="difficulty difficulty-easy">Easy</span></div>
    <div class="topic-list" data-visible="true"><span>Arrays</span><span>Hash Table</span></div>
    <p>Find the two indices whose values add up to the target.</p>
    <div class="example-data problem-example"><div><span class="value-label" aria-label="Sample input"><Icon name="input" /></span><code>nums = [2, 7, 11, 15], target = 9</code></div><div><span class="value-label" aria-label="Sample output"><Icon name="output" /></span><code>[0, 1]</code></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
